  "meta": {
    "about": "FilmCraft → VectorCraft → array engine → PhotoCraft. FilmCraft renders a frame of its ocean-sunset footage; VectorCraft traces it into flat colour and makes four hue-shifted screen prints; the array engine tiles them two by two; PhotoCraft adds paper grain and a faded-film look so it reads as a print. Pick another scene in Demo footage for a different set.",
    "tags": [
      "art",
      "video-to-image",
      "pop-art"
    ],
    "title": "Four sunsets, Warhol-style"
  },
